{"type": 3}, "seed": 1137651679, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 599707678, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "a = [1, 2, 2]", "originalText": "a = [1, 2, 2]", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 28, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t43", "type": "text", "x": 460, "y": 840, "width": 900, "height": 35, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a43", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1059257081, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1128466621, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "b = [4, 4, 2]", "originalText": "b = [4, 4, 2]", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 28, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t44", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1330, "width": 1100, "height": 59, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a44", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1840109256, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1715412120, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Δz = 0 here: both points float at height 2.\nPythagoras just gains one more squared term per dimension.", "originalText": "Δz = 0 here: both points float at height 2.\nPythagoras just gains one more squared term per dimension.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 24, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "r45", "type": "rectangle", "x": 640, "y": 800, "width": 460, "height": 380, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a45", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1554762904, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 941975481, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t46", "type": "text", "x": 670, "y": 820, "width": 420, "height": 337, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a46", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 594130309, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2119634400, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Step 1: subtract\na − b = [1−4, 2−4, 2−2]\n= [−3, −2, 0]\n\nStep 2: square and add\n(−3)² + (−2)² + 0²\n= 9 + 4 + 0 = 13\n\nStep 3: square root\n√13 ≈ 3.61", "originalText": "Step 1: subtract\na − b = [1−4, 2−4, 2−2]\n= [−3, −2, 0]\n\nStep 2: square and add\n(−3)² + (−2)² + 0²\n= 9 + 4 + 0 = 13\n\nStep 3: square root\n√13 ≈ 3.61", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 27, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "r47", "type": "rectangle", "x": 710, "y": 1200, "width": 320, "height": 64, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffd6dd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a47", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 390452953, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 202363286, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t48", "type": "text", "x": 710, "y": 1212, "width": 320, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a48", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 470939446, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 656448480, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "d(a, b) ≈ 3.61", "originalText": "d(a, b) ≈ 3.61", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 33, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "r49", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1230, "y": 140, "width": 750, "height": 1230, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a49", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 687117442, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1813163241, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t50", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 175, "width": 680, "height": 43, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a50", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 272849425, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1652563014, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "What it measures", "originalText": "What it measures", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 35, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t51", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 220, "width": 680, "height": 72, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a51", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1639042339, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2010258947, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "It measures the straight-line\ndistance between two points.", "originalText": "It measures the straight-line\ndistance between two points.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 29, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t52", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 300, "width": 680, "height": 43, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a52", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1079815405, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 49310609, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "How to read the score", "originalText": "How to read the score", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 35, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t53", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 345, "width": 680, "height": 145, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a53", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 491995980, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1146005449, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "The score is a distance.\n0 = identical points.\nA lower score shows more similarity.\nThe score has no upper limit.", "originalText": "The score is a distance.\n0 = identical points.\nA lower score shows more similarity.\nThe score has no upper limit.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 29, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t54", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 500, "width": 680, "height": 43, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a54", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1461042544, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 479112938, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Why it works", "originalText": "Why it works", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 35, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t55", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 545, "width": 680, "height": 145, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a55", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1260573449, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1867302555, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "It uses the Pythagorean theorem.\nSubtract each pair of values.\nSquare each result. Add the squares.\nThen calculate the square root.", "originalText": "It uses the Pythagorean theorem.\nSubtract each pair of values.\nSquare each result. Add the squares.\nThen calculate the square root.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 29, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t56", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 700, "width": 680, "height": 43, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a56", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 679282379, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1948728484, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "When to use it", "originalText": "When to use it", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 35, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t57", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 745, "width": 680, "height": 109, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a57", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 13938522, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1131247331, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Use it for embeddings that trained\nwith L2 (common for images).\nIVF and k-means clustering also use it.", "originalText": "Use it for embeddings that trained\nwith L2 (common for images).\nIVF and k-means clustering also use it.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 29, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t58", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 875, "width": 680, "height": 43, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a58", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 767303989, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 457031005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Watch out", "originalText": "Watch out", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 35, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t59", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 920, "width": 680, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a59", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1281810601, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 854316682, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Length has an effect. [1, 2] and [10, 20]\nhave the same direction, and the\ndistance between them is large.\nMany systems do not calculate the √.\nThe squared distance gives the same\norder of results.", "originalText": "Length has an effect. [1, 2] and [10, 20]\nhave the same direction, and the\ndistance between them is large.\nMany systems do not calculate the √.\nThe squared distance gives the same\norder of results.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 29, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t60", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 1140, "width": 680, "height": 43, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a60", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 656439678, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1605947757, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "2D vs 3D", "originalText": "2D vs 3D", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 35, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "t61", "type": "text", "x": 1270, "y": 1185, "width": 680, "height": 72, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a61", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 693847830, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2456274, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "3D adds one term: (Δz)².\nA 1536-d embedding has 1536 terms.", "originalText": "3D adds one term: (Δz)².\nA 1536-d embedding has 1536 terms.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 29, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}